  "body": "Specification:\r\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/forms.html#textFieldSelection:do-not-apply\r\nWPT:\r\nhttp://w3c-test.org/html/semantics/forms/the-input-element/selection.html\r\n\r\nFor example\r\n select() for <input type=hidden> should throw according to the specification and the WPT test. However, Sometimes it Edge, Firefox, Google Chrome, and Safari throws.\r\n",
